    "findings": [
      {
        "id": "PLAN-FACT-01-FINDING-001",
        "severity": "blocking",
        "clauseId": "FACT-01:REQ-001",
        "message": "The approved specification's Boundary conditions state, “No maximum input size or other numeric limit is specified.” The plan's Risks and rollback section acknowledges JavaScript's exact-integer limit but leaves the exact-result strategy unresolved and does not plan a large-result test. A Number-based implementation could pass the planned nCr(5, 2) example and boundary tests while returning a rounded, incorrect count for another valid positive-integer input. Specify an exact integer/result representation without narrowing the approved input domain, and plan a test whose correct result exceeds Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER."
      }
    ]
